	(text "Qi TX module supply: own 9 V boost + LC filter - Ansonia power board rev A (rev G shell)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4d7464fd-5f9b-5917-835c-347d604b1ae6")
	)
	(text "Why a second boost: amp 9.4 W + Qi module ~18 W (15 W TX) = 28 W at 9 V = 3.1 A out = 9.4 A in at 3.3 V (90 %), but the TPS61088 peak"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 21.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5f0b8b8-1079-53a7-96d7-7864f6d5a6c3")
	)
	(text "limit in FPWM at 49.9k is 7.2 A minimum (SLVSE52A, electrical table). Qi alone is 6.3 A average + 1.6 A ripple, also too close. Separate rail"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 23.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76fb105f-356c-5bd9-bd20-93041dc570e3")
	)
	(text "also keeps the Qi converter's switching noise off PVDD. U7 enable = QI_EN (carrier expander 0x22 P6 via J1, 10k pull-down)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "481528a6-ad9b-58fe-af11-97a9b04ef616")
	)
	(text "LC filter: 1 uH (Isat >= 4 A) + 2 x 10 uF between the boost output caps and J6. 9 V at J6: the module must accept 9 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 28.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5dfb4175-8961-5d61-9b8b-b4fd61a0f78a")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
